  <item>
    <title>EP5: 我在南极科考，顺便逃避内卷寻找人生松弛感</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66697bd0c26e396a36450576</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66697bd0c26e396a36450576</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Jun 2024 10:43:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>多年的老友去了一趟南极科考，来聊聊他的一些冒险感想与心得。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">2:00</a>怎么就去了南极</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">6:54</a> 行前准备，注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">23:53</a>美国大兵把我运去南极</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a>美国南极站の日常生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3027">50:27</a>南极怎么上厕所</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3609">1:00:09</a> 5周纯户外南极glamping</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4766">1:19:26</a> 与老美在极地听马思唯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5050">1:24:10</a> 在南极，我放空了自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5696">1:34:56</a> 南极生活结束，一些感想</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢陈铭提供的南极生活照片：</span></p><span></span><p><span>美军运输机：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk7OFYoHEP5OSnuxjwKhyWzPTMBq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>南极风景</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lp7s9pieMwx8k6YjSpUbyxyaB4sn.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgQ2y59yJmXeN4Z7bgkOPqY6DLJP.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>科考环境：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpN_Q6xGYqlWJgPVPzBHn169rylq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-TZCoAFlp2lH5tNgoYRTu_Y5JX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi1_PeltG6_WvenXornQLBmYBfUF.jpg"></figure><span></span><ol><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ol>]]></description>
