    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>邀请了多年的好友Tom，一位在加州的年轻创业人士，来闲聊在北美的科技生活和AI行业的发展，在创业中体会失败和投降～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="134">2:14</a> 在Rivian实习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">8:07</a> 北美的tech startup氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a> 学校的program</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 怎么开始创业的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 面对创业学业的失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1724">28:44</a> 现在的创业产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> Open AI与AI创业风口</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> AI行业的未来发展与思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2479">41:19</a> AI查重的悖论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2855">47:35</a> AI是一个黑盒子</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rivian的加州总部一景：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fokb98FbP5Mx0vbeTKW9rkUI2Ayy.png"></figure>]]></description>
