  <item>
    <title>EP2: 和文森特一起飞～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cc5caccace72dff8cd2580</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cc5caccace72dff8cd2580</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Feb 2024 06:24:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>一期两个喜欢旅游的人关于飞行，罗马尼亚，埃及，和台湾的聊天～</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>vincent的b站：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@和文森特一起飞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/25078506?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0" href="https://space.bilibili.com/25078506?spm_id_from=333.337.0.0">space.bilibili.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>youtube：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@和文森特一起飞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@flywvincent" href="https://www.youtube.com/@flywvincent">www.youtube.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@驴子本杰明-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6254325354" href="https://weibo.com/u/6254325354">weibo.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Instagram：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@vinceflies</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.instagram.com/vinceflies" href="https://www.instagram.com/vinceflies">www.instagram.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎大家关注！</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">1:34</a> 为什么喜欢飞行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">2:49</a> 飞机是个很神奇的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">4:34</a> 太平洋跳岛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 飞到罗马尼亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="891">14:51</a> 流亡的俄罗斯人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> 贝加尔湖狂飙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> 开罗和垃圾城</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a> 埃及糟糕的旅游环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 没有封顶的楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a> 金字塔里的神秘仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 一个“新开罗”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 冬日台北与外省人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2197">36:37</a> 台湾是一个巨大的社会实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 松山机场夜景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 两人的台北印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2732">45:32</a> 未来旅行的计划</span></p><span></span><p><span>美联航跳岛航线：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi9tPQQQWTwEE1hxaV8ZbpmoxXkd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>罗马尼亚的布加勒斯特：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlMkndXaYdVOnPLmdNUIttPsSf_N.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>开罗：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNYjzSO84Dma0-Tg6nxn__zv03H.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj5uumkUvvqQIwawmX5eQBKyrqiq.JPG"></p><span></span><p><span>台北：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl5e7NlUCn3PzRT7gqY_ro9ALgtH.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fso1X8g6d8b1SGhMHnJr_4N5e8yW.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>台南：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flkbn8pdqE-52ALeQIBtrozEKB_Z.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Logo&amp;Art: Moira Huang&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ins:@moira_des</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.instagram.com/moira_des?igsh=bWU5eW8xdmFuM2oz" href="https://www.instagram.com/moira_des?igsh=bWU5eW8xdmFuM2oz">www.instagram.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
