  <item>
    <title>EP1: 啊！我的家，满洲利亚！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c9d5dadde969cfdc8ef8b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c9d5dadde969cfdc8ef8b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Feb 2024 08:24:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于2023暑假在东北行走的一些记忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">1:20</a> 东北初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">4:51</a> 去鞍山的夜车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">7:08</a> 鞍钢博物馆与鞍山市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1311">21:51</a> 辽阳与弓长岭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a> 中国的东北与美国的东北</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> 乡村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> 辽阳之夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2997">49:57</a> 齐大山铁矿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">55:25</a> 大连，与日占时期的历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3917">1:05:17</a> 长白山，自然，与山岳崇拜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">1:11:36</a> 东北印象与未来</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：开头：松花江上 - 中国交响乐团</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾：白桦林 - 朴树</span></p><span></span><p><span>鞍钢博物馆：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCQqgPsUJdNmmqc0fpHxXLwTuK0.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>辽阳铁矿：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulcKhXwxPBC2h2uv7GWJ1LE9A0f.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLc1K3ppd4QVlhxIqD8hVJsZom2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>高家村：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FikHHrXR_K_Q-7lL4xTheIlTqtDP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>废弃小学：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-RH_FwbxitHXA0hvvczGNiH5Lx.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj142aEGdRbGTyHaysW3epuBir3a.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCQcquBIF6sxBaUuco71AqXZkKq.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>齐大山铁矿：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhN_UjtiJNN0xD2WSLLQVwIMYYsB.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgroazXWaNPQbA1RN_-37b15W4Ks.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkpy_WNdjtr_FNJBt2mTbwLvGnWP.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPuPZZWXnGZwx6TdrsU0L-H55T4.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>井下矿：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMFw2avS9SJbnyaQ4seH1WcHtJL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Logo&amp;Art: Moira Huang&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ins:@moira_des</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.instagram.com/moira_des?igsh=bWU5eW8xdmFuM2oz" href="https://www.instagram.com/moira_des?igsh=bWU5eW8xdmFuM2oz">www.instagram.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
